  Id: Card_Safe_Zone
  CardName: Safe Zone
  Description: Upon selecting this card, 1 visually distinct tile is randomly selected
    on the 8x8 grid. When a shape is placed covering this tile, the combo multiplier's
    drop floor becomes 2x (meaning it will not drop below 2x upon a reset) as long
    as that shape is not destroyed by a line clear. If the combo is already below
    2x, it remains as is. However, if that specific tile is cleared via a line clear,
    the player is penalized and loses 8 shapes from their current pool.
